+
+## 2. Proposed M2 component graph
+
+```mermaid
+graph TD
+  SC[1. Security contracts<br/>Aeron.Contracts] --> PDE[3. PolicyDecisionEngine]
+  SC --> OAG[2. OwnerAuthorityGuard]
+  SC --> PH[5. Parameter-hashing infrastructure]
